# SYNTAX TEST "text.html.tiddlywiki5" "A style element parses its content as wikitext"

# TiddlyWiki carries NO notion of a scoped stylesheet: `scoped` names an ordinary attribute and
# the word appears nowhere in its source. A `<style>` element takes the html rule like any
# other, so its CHILDREN parse as wikitext, and a call or a transclusion standing in a
# stylesheet builds a node. Measured against the host tree: `<style>{{!!text}}[test="<<n>>"]`
# in `core/wiki/debugstylesheets.tid` builds a transcludeinline and a macrocallinline, and
# `StaticRiver.tid` and `github-fork-ribbon/template.tid` each carry a transclusion as the
# whole body of a stylesheet.
#
# This grammar hands the content to `source.css`, which paints a call as one property value.
#
# GROUND, MEASURED over every carrier TiddlyWiki ships: 25 `<style>` elements across 25
# carriers, ONE of them carrying `scoped`. Inside them, the host builds calls at four sites,
# and NO sigil run stands where the host builds nothing — the false-positive cost a macrocall
# rule reaching into ordinary CSS would carry measures zero on this ground.
#
# `$:/SplashScreen` reaches this gap by another road and must not count toward it: it opens
# `\rules only filteredtranscludeinline transcludeinline macrocallinline`, which deletes the
# html rule, so the host builds no style ELEMENT there at all and reads the whole block as
# text carrying three inline rules. The rule-set mutation ceiling governs that one.
#
# WHAT AN ENACTMENT OWES BEFORE IT LANDS: `macrocallinline` and `transcludeinline` carry no
# line bound, and a child region standing open refuses its parent's end — so a `<<` inside a
# stylesheet with no `>>` ahead runs past `</style>` and takes the rest of the tiddler. Take
# `npm run swallow-witness` to the injection before adopting it; the gain measures four sites
# and the SWALLOW family costs whole carriers.

<style>
.tc-splash-text { color: <<colour foreground>>; }
#                        ^^ punctuation.definition.procedurecallinline.begin.tiddlywiki5
#                          ^^^^^^ variable.name.procedure.tiddlywiki5
#                                           ^^ punctuation.definition.procedurecallinline.end.tiddlywiki5
</style>

<style>
{{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/github-fork-ribbon/styles}}
#<- punctuation.definition.transclusion.transcludeinline.begin.tiddlywiki5
</style>
